//---------------
#dynamic 0x740000
#org @PokeMartLavanderTown
lock
faceplayer
special 0x187
compare LASTRESULT 0x2
if 0x1 goto @End
preparemsg @MSGGreeting
waitmsg
pokemart @MRTLavanderTown
msgbox @MSGGoodbye MSG_KEEPOPEN
release
end

//---------------
#org @End
end


//---------
// Strings
//---------
#org @MSGGreeting
= Hi, there!\nMay I help you?

#org @MSGGoodbye
= Please come again!

